{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/22/1698586/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46 4th Anniversary カウントダウン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂4歳のお誕生日を迎えました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おめでとう！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"因みに\nここらへんから14th制服になってました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今さらですがライブまでが13th制服"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブが46hTVＴシャツ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、\nピザハットを頼みました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この時間からピザを食べました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めちゃくちゃ美味しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/22/1698586/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田は\nゴールデン絶品チーズ4とマルゲリータ\n2枚も食べちゃった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/22/1698586/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/22/1698586/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木中コメンタリー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"表題曲のタイトル発表後"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「3期生オーディション」と\n「3期生募集セミナー」の発表が\nありました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/22/1698586/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エンディング"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"未央奈の電視台では\nあまり活躍しなかった\nトルティーヤくんが\nここにきて活躍するとは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フィンランド民謡\nサライかと思いました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のぎ声リレーは\n中田はスタジオにずっといて\nどこも行かなかった人だったんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全国からこんなに協力してもらえて\n本当に嬉しかったです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感動してしまいました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に本当にありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/22/1698586/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/22/1698586/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんなに\n濃ゆい2日間は\n人生で初めてですね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4年目にして\nさらにメンバーの絆が深まった気がします"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フォローしあいながら\n一緒に46時間駆け抜けたメンバー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"46時間始まる前から\n寝ないで準備してくださったスタッフさん方"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして\n見てくださったみなさん\n本当に本当にありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/22/1698586/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}